    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cross-post text to X, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and LinkedIn\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Sets the caption used to build the post.\n3. Publishes posts to X (Twitter), Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and LinkedIn via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] In the Set post text node, set the caption to your own content.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the caption in the Set post text node to publish different content. Run it any time to post, or connect a Schedule Trigger to automate it. Remove the Publish nodes you do not need to target fewer platforms.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 568
      },
